          "text": "Low mood and related symptoms"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Since stopping sertraline approximately 6–8 weeks ago, reports increased tearfulness, withdrawal, low motivation, fatigue, poor sleep, and feeling guilty and useless on days off."
      }
    },
